 "mechanism": "UNKNOWN. Ruled out: no `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)` block in the built CSS resets an outline (searched the concatenated bundle); `--focus-outline-width` computes to 2px on the ringless elements themselves. The ringless controls compute `outline-color: currentColor` -- the INITIAL value -- so the global `:focus-visible {outline: var(--focus-outline-width) solid var(--accent)}` rule (one definition in the bundle) did not apply to them at all. A cascade question, not a token one.",
