  "how_the_hash_is_taken": "sha256 over every file in the built bundle, in sorted relative-path order, hashing `<relative path>\\0<bytes>` for each. `sha256_all_files` covers all 406 files; `sha256_excluding_build_id` omits `build-id.json`, which carries a per-build stamp and is the ONLY file that is not reproducible.",
